     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Status of Implementation Progress: Physical component. Following works are completed (i) construction of three new 220 kilovolts Asht-Kairakkum, Geran-Rumi, and Sughd-Kairakkum transmission lines totalling 216 km; (ii) rehabilitation of whole or part of the five (Kairakkum, Asht, Rumi, Baipaza, and Regar-500) and construction of new one (Geran-2) substations; and (iii) installation of a supervisory control and data acquisition system linked to national control centre and priority substations across the country.

